hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24042","Narrated to us Abd al-Malik ibn Amr, narrated to us Ibn Abi Dhib, from al-Zuhri, from Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham, from Nawfal ibn Muawiyah, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever misses the prayer, it is as if his family and wealth were taken away."
